The Kobayashi IV locks into her clamp at Hollow Spire with fuel to spare and no one waiting on the apron. Water-ration notices hang peeling from the dock rails, and a single pump rattles somewhere below. Vance Oduya looks up from the berth console as you come off the ramp. He turns the screen a few degrees away from you, then seems to think better of it. "You're quicker than the courier was," he says. "Which makes me wonder who's in a hurry."

